# `make examples-build` runs `go build` with no -o, so each example lands in the
# repo root as a ~50 MB binary named after its package. Anchored to the root on
# purpose: a bare pattern would also match extension/platform/examples/<name>/,
# excluding the sources themselves.
/audit-observer
/audit-observer.exe
/readonly-policy
/readonly-policy.exe
